### 视频文案提取待处理队列接口测试
### 作者: RayChou
### 创建时间: 2025-08-14
### 描述: 查询待处理和处理中状态的用户视频表数据的API测试用例

### 1. 查询当前用户的待处理队列
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/pending-queue
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. 使用不同用户token查询（权限测试）
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/pending-queue
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user2_token}}

### 3. 使用子账号token查询
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/pending-queue
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sub_user_token}}

### 4. 使用主账号token查询
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/pending-queue
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{main_user_token}}

### ========================================
### 不同场景测试
### ========================================

### 5. 空队列场景（用户没有待处理任务）
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/pending-queue
Content-Type: application/json
# 使用没有待处理任务的用户token

### 6. 大量待处理任务场景
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/pending-queue
Content-Type: application/json
# 使用有大量待处理任务的用户token

### 7. 混合状态场景（包含PENDING和PROCESSING）
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/pending-queue
Content-Type: application/json
# 用户同时有待处理和处理中的任务

### ========================================
### 边界测试
### ========================================

### 8. 无效token测试
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/pending-queue
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token

### 9. 过期token测试
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/pending-queue
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer expired_token

### 10. 缺少token测试
GET http://localhost:8080/replay/video/extract/pending-queue
Content-Type: application/json

